      "heading": "Rajesh Kumar vs The State Of Maharashtra And Anr on 22 April, 2024",
      "level": 2,
      "content": []
    },
    {
      "heading": "Bench: Prakash D. Naik , N. R. Borkar",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        "i) Criminal Writ Petition No. 4339 of 2019, Criminal Writ Petition (ST.) No. 5783 Of 2024, Criminal Writ Petition (ST.) No.6192 of 2024, Criminal Writ Petition (ST.) No. 6206 of 2024, Criminal Writ Petition (ST.) No. 6239 of 2024, Criminal Writ Petition No.4563 of 2019, Criminal Writ Petition No. 4649 of 2019, Criminal Writ Petition No.6532 of 2021 and Criminal Writ Petition No.1467 of 2023 are allowed and disposed off.",
        "ii) Criminal Proceedings pending before the concerned Court which are arising out of First Information Reports in all these Petitions are quashed and set aside.",
        "iii) The Passport of the Petitioner Rajesh Kumar be handed over to him on compliance of Consent Terms and the amount of Rs.20 Lakhs deposited in the Court of learned Metropolitan Magistrate, 32nd Court at Bandra, Mumbai is allowed to be withdrawn by the Petitioner Rajesh Kumar on compliance of Consent Terms.",
        "iv) The Petitioner in Criminal Writ Petition No. 4339 Of 2019, Criminal Writ Petition No. 4563 Of 2019, Criminal Writ Petition No. 4649 Of 2019, Criminal Writ Petition No. 6532 Of 2021 shall pay cost of Rs.50,000/- in each Petition and Petitioners in in Criminal Writ Petition No.1467 of 2023 & Criminal Writ Petition (ST.) No. 6206 of 2024, Writ Petition (St.) No.6239 of 2024, Criminal Writ Petition (st.) 6192 of 2024 shall pay cost of Rs.25,000/- in each Petition to Police Welfare Fund, Director General of Police, Maharashtra State, Sajakali Jamadar 18 of 19 ::: Uploaded on - 29/04/2024 ::: Downloaded on - 11/05/2024 09:17:03 ::: 1-WP-4339-2019.doc Mumbai within a period of four weeks from today. The details of the bank account for payment of cost are as under:-",
        "(N. R. BORKAR, J.) (PRAKASH D. NAIK, J.) Sajakali Jamadar 19 of 19 ::: Uploaded on - 29/04/2024 ::: Downloaded on - 11/05/2024 09:17:03 :::"
      ]
    },
